      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office opened in 1917, and by the early 1920s Cuney boasted a drugstore, hotel, and several cotton gins.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuney%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Freed slaves first settled the area just after the Civil War, establishing the roots of what would become Cuney.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
