      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuney%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Before being called Cuney, the settlement was known as Andy, after Andrew Bragg, one of the first Black homeowners in 1870.",
